{"id": "51758", "title": "菩提", "author": "喜了", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/51/51758.htm", "intro": "情罪！ \r\n\r\n说起来，我和童航属于赶早型。高中早恋，大学一毕业就结了婚，婚后第二年就有了虎子，早早献身柴米油盐，胸无大志，甘于平淡。其实，所有的人都在替我们不值。他那圈子的，我这圈子的，现在看来，哪个不是人物，只俺两口子，一个中学里教书，一个社区里的片警儿，属于最没出息的那种。", "base": "files/article/html/51/51758", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "7356493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "7356495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "7356496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "7356498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "7356500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "7356508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "7356514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "7356517.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "7356519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "7356523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "7356524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "7356527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "7356529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "7356533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "7356537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "7356540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "结章", "file": "7356542.html", "available": false}]}